.EE
.PP
yaml.readerNew flag: generated fromYaml methods throw on a key with no field and on a missing key (as json.STRICT)
.SS ERR_DECODE
.EX
0x6B746D14
.EE
.PP
The code a Reader throws for text that isn't YAML (or uses a part of it yaml doesn't support) and for a value of the wrong kind. The message says where: "3:14: items[2].price: expected a number, got a string".
.SS ERR_WRITER
.EX
0x6B746D15
.EE
.PP
The code a Writer throws when it is used out of order (a value where a key is expected, a key outside a mapping, end() with nothing open, take() before the document is complete) or given a string that isn't UTF-8. The message says which.
.SS MAX_DEPTH
.EX
512
.EE
.PP
Mappings and sequences nested deeper than this are an error
